OL,3,GNEWSADozens of rare heritage sites to
OL,4,Aopen up for free
OL,5,
OL,6,FHeritage sites across the West of
OL,7,FEngland will open their doors to
OL,8,Fvisitors for free as part of a festival
OL,9,Fto celebrate history and culture.
OL,11,FDozens of events, which have been
OL,12,Forganised as part of Heritage Open
OL,13,FDays, will take place across Bristol,
OL,14,FGloucestershire, Somerset and Wiltshire
OL,15,Ffrom 11 to 20 September.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
